{"seq":2,"slug":"emitters-lifecycle","title":"发射器与生命周期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-vfx-particle-systems/foundations/emitters-lifecycle","wordCount":1453,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"发射器与生命周期\">发射器与生命周期</h1><p><a href=\"particle-system-architecture\">粒子系统架构</a> 把系统拆成发射器、模块流水线、粒子池三件套，但留下两个具体问题没答：发射器到底按什么规律往池子里&quot;生&quot;粒子？一个粒子被生出来之后，它的颜色、大小、透明度又凭什么随时间变化？这两个问题——<strong>生成节奏</strong>与<strong>生命周期演化</strong>——是粒子从&quot;出生&quot;到&quot;消亡&quot;全过程的控制逻辑，也是美术调一个特效时摸得最多的旋钮。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>发射器的工作可以分成两个独立的决策：<strong>何时生、生多少（spawn）</strong>，以及<strong>生出来初值是什么（initialize）</strong>。生成节奏主要有两种模式，外加它们的组合：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[发射器 Emitter] --&gt; B{生成模式}&#10;  B --&gt;|持续| C[Rate 速率&lt;br/&gt;每秒 R 个 · 累积小数余量]&#10;  B --&gt;|瞬时| D[Burst 爆发&lt;br/&gt;在 t 时刻一次性生 N 个]&#10;  B --&gt;|组合| E[Rate + 多个 Burst&lt;br/&gt;如持续烟 + 起始火球爆发]&#10;  C --&gt; F[Initialize 初值模块&lt;br/&gt;初始位置/速度/颜色/大小/寿命]&#10;  D --&gt; F&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[进入粒子池 · 开始按生命周期演化]\">flowchart TD\n  A[发射器 Emitter] --&gt; B{生成模式}\n  B --&gt;|持续| C[Rate 速率&lt;br/&gt;每秒 R 个 · 累积小数余量]\n  B --&gt;|瞬时| D[Burst 爆发&lt;br/&gt;在 t 时刻一次性生 N 个]\n  B --&gt;|组合| E[Rate + 多个 Burst&lt;br/&gt;如持续烟 + 起始火球爆发]\n  C --&gt; F[Initialize 初值模块&lt;br/&gt;初始位置/速度/颜色/大小/寿命]\n  D --&gt; F\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[进入粒子池 · 开始按生命周期演化]</pre><p>下表对比两种生成模式的典型用途与陷阱：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>典型特效</th>\n<th>常见陷阱</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Rate 持续速率</td>\n<td>每秒粒子数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>火把、烟囱、瀑布、尘埃</td>\n<td>帧率波动导致间隔不均，需余量累积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Burst 瞬时爆发</td>\n<td>时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>、数量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>爆炸、命中火花、跳跃落地尘</td>\n<td>一帧生太多造成卡顿尖峰</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rate+Burst 组合</td>\n<td>两者叠加</td>\n<td>法术（爆发核心+持续余烬）</td>\n<td>发射器数量膨胀，注意合并</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"生成速率与帧率无关性\">生成速率与帧率无关性</h2><p>持续发射的核心难题是：发射速率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>（个/秒）通常不是帧率的整数倍。若帧间隔 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dt</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>，则本帧应生成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R \\cdot dt</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 个——但这往往是小数，比如 60 帧下 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R=100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span> 时每帧 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.667</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.667</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.667</span></span></span></span></span> 个。直接取整会系统性少生、且产生节奏抖动。正确做法是<strong>累积小数余量</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"spawnAccumulator += rate * dt;        // 累积应生成的（含小数）总量&#10;int n = (int)spawnAccumulator;        // 本帧实际生成整数个&#10;spawnAccumulator -= n;                 // 把不足 1 个的余量留到下帧&#10;for (int k = 0; k &lt; n; ++k) emitOne();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">spawnAccumulator </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dt;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 累积应生成的（含小数）总量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)spawnAccumulator;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 本帧实际生成整数个</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">spawnAccumulator </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                 // 把不足 1 个的余量留到下帧</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> k </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; k </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n; </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">k) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">emitOne</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这样长期平均速率精确等于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>，与帧率无关。更精细的实现还会做<strong>子帧抖动（sub-frame spawn）</strong>：把这 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个粒子的出生时刻均匀散布在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[t, t+dt]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 区间内，并按各自已存在的时间提前积分一小步，避免高速发射时粒子在出生点&quot;扎堆&quot;成一条可见的接缝。这一点在快速移动的发射器（飞弹尾迹）上尤其重要，否则尾迹会变成一串离散的团块而非连续的带。</p>\n<h2 id=\"年龄-寿命与归一化生命\">年龄、寿命与归一化生命</h2><p>每个粒子带两个时间属性：<strong>年龄 age</strong>（已存在的秒数，每帧加 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dt</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>）与<strong>寿命 life</strong>（注定的总秒数，出生时随机抽取）。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">age \\ge life</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span>，剔除模块将其回收（见架构篇的 swap-and-pop）。真正驱动视觉演化的是二者的比值——<strong>归一化生命 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span></strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau = \\frac{age}{life} \\in [0, 1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.988em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 把&quot;不同寿命的粒子&quot;统一到同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 进度轴上，所有随时间变化的属性都以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 为自变量查曲线。这是粒子系统里最重要的一个量：一条曲线写一次，长寿命粒子慢慢走完、短寿命粒子快速走完，视觉节奏自动一致。寿命本身通常带随机性，比如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>lerp</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>f</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>f</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>ξ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">life = \\text{lerp}(life_{min}, life_{max}, \\xi)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">lerp</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">min</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ξ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\xi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.046em;\">ξ</span></span></span></span></span> 为均匀随机数——让一束火花有快有慢、不齐刷刷消失。</p>\n<h2 id=\"属性曲线-让演化平滑可控\">属性曲线：让演化平滑可控</h2><p>颜色、大小、透明度、速度衰减等都不该是常数，而该随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 演化。**属性曲线（curve over life）**就是把这些属性定义成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 的函数，由美术在编辑器里拉曲线。典型的火花：大小先快速膨胀再缓慢收缩、颜色从亮黄经橙红到暗红、alpha 在末段淡出。</p>\n<p>下面是一个查曲线的更新片段，颜色与 alpha 用渐变（gradient over life）、大小用曲线：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"float tau = p.age / p.life;&#10;p.color = colorGradient.eval(tau);    // 沿 τ 取渐变色&#10;p.alpha = alphaCurve.eval(tau);       // 末段淡出，避免突兀消失&#10;p.size  = sizeCurve.eval(tau) * p.initialSize; // 膨胀-收缩\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tau </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p.age </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p.life;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">p.color </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> colorGradient.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">eval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(tau);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 沿 τ 取渐变色</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">p.alpha </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> alphaCurve.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">eval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(tau);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       // 末段淡出，避免突兀消失</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">p.size  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sizeCurve.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">eval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(tau) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p.initialSize;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 膨胀-收缩</span></span></code></pre></div><p>末段 alpha 必须平滑归零——粒子若在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 时还不透明就被瞬间剔除，会产生肉眼可见的&quot;啪&quot;地消失。这一条朴素规则是区分专业与业余特效的细节之一。属性曲线只解决&quot;随时间怎么变&quot;，而&quot;随空间受力怎么动&quot;（位置、速度的演化）是 <a href=\"../simulation/forces-motion\">力与运动</a> 的主题——曲线管美学、力场管动力学，两者在同一套 per-particle 属性上协作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"继承-对齐与坐标空间\">继承、对齐与坐标空间</h2><p>粒子出生时的初值还涉及两个易错点。其一是<strong>坐标空间</strong>：粒子位置是存在<strong>世界空间</strong>还是<strong>局部空间</strong>？局部空间下粒子跟随发射器移动（适合附在角色身上的光环），世界空间下粒子出生后脱离发射器（适合飞弹喷出后留在原地的尾迹）。选错会导致&quot;角色一动，本该留在身后的尾迹也跟着平移&quot;的穿帮。其二是<strong>速度继承</strong>：高速移动的发射器喷粒子时，应让粒子继承一部分发射器速度，否则尾迹会相对世界静止、看起来像从空中凭空冒出。这些初始化策略由发射器的 initialize 模块设定，是后续模拟章一切运动的起点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>发射器有两类决策：生成节奏（Rate 持续 / Burst 爆发 / 二者组合）与初值设置。</li>\n<li>Rate 发射必须累积小数余量以做到帧率无关，高速发射还需子帧抖动避免扎堆。</li>\n<li>归一化生命 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau = age/life</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span> 是统一的演化进度轴，所有随时间变化的属性都以它查曲线。</li>\n<li>属性曲线/渐变让颜色、大小、alpha 平滑演化；末段 alpha 必须归零以免突兀消失。</li>\n<li>坐标空间（世界/局部）与速度继承决定粒子是否正确跟随发射器，选错即穿帮。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>三部件如何协作、池如何回收：<a href=\"particle-system-architecture\">粒子系统架构</a></li>\n<li>出生后的受力运动：<a href=\"../simulation/forces-motion\">力与运动</a></li>\n<li>单粒子内部的序列帧动画（另一种&quot;随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 演化&quot;）：<a href=\"../simulation/flipbooks-animation\">序列帧与动画</a></li>\n<li>曲线/插值的数学背景（关键帧与缓动）：<a href=\"../../game-animation-systems/\">游戏动画系统</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"发射器与生命周期","id":"发射器与生命周期"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"生成速率与帧率无关性","id":"生成速率与帧率无关性"},{"level":2,"text":"年龄、寿命与归一化生命","id":"年龄-寿命与归一化生命"},{"level":2,"text":"属性曲线：让演化平滑可控","id":"属性曲线-让演化平滑可控"},{"level":2,"text":"继承、对齐与坐标空间","id":"继承-对齐与坐标空间"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"粒子系统架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-vfx-particle-systems/foundations/particle-system-architecture"},"next":{"title":"GPU 粒子与计算着色器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-vfx-particle-systems/foundations/gpu-particles-compute"}}